(footprint "ClockxControl_GBA_GBC"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "manual")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "insideGadgets GBA/GBC ClockxControl (iG CLK GEN) mezzanine landing pattern. The module is 18.65 x 12.00 mm and floats flat on the host board; its I/O pads are plated through-holes, so it is fixed by dropping solder through the hole onto the pad below. Geometry taken from MouseBiteLabs DMGC-CPU-01 rev 2.5 (Game Boy DMG Color), which carries the first known host-side footprint for this module. Pads 1/2/3 are the module's button inputs; on a GBA firmware these are 1=Select, 2=L, 3=R. CLK, V+ and V- are NOT solder-through here - their positions on the module have not been measured - so they are wired to nearby pads, exactly as the DMG Color board does.")
	(tags "clockxcontrol insidegadgets mezzanine gba gbc overclock")
